f=\"https://www.usnews.com/news/national-news/articles/2026-09-11/no-letup-in-inflation-in-august-as-cpi-rises-0-4\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noopener\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://www.usnews.com/news/national-news/articles/2026-09-11/no-letup-in-inflation-in-august-as-cpi-rises-0-4\">CPI report</a></span>, the European Central Bank’s (\"ECB\") <span><a href=\"https://www.ecb.europa.eu/press/press_conference/visual-mps/2026/html/mopo_statement_explained_september.en.html\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noopener\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://www.ecb.europa.eu/press/press_conference/visual-mps/2026/html/mopo_statement_explained_september.en.html\">rate hike</a></span></p></body></html>",
